{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09175","headline":"送豆卢策秀才 · 韦应物","name":"送豆卢策秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁交冰未泮，地卑海气昏。\n子有京师游，始发吴阊门。\n新黄含远林，微绿生陈根。\n诗人感时节，行道当忧烦。\n古来濩落者，俱不事田园。\n文如金石韵，岂乏知音言。\n方辞郡斋榻，爲酌离亭罇。\n无爲倦羁旅，一去高飞翻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09175.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09175","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}